// # app/telemetry — Metrics + Event Bus
//
// Logline: The per-process counter export and the generic event bus that decouples cross-cutting telemetry from the producing subsystems.
//
// Beats:
//   1. event.h — the oo_event_emit / oo_event_subscribe API.
//   2. event.c — the mutex-guarded subscriber table.
//   3. metrics.c — the counter export; subscribes to 8 named events via a constructor.
//
